---
// No props — self-contained diagram
const stages = [
  { n: '01', name: 'Introductions',   desc: 'Meet the team, set expectations, confirm consent.' },
  { n: '02', name: 'Warm-up',         desc: 'Current planning habits, tools already in use.' },
  { n: '03', name: 'Future framing',  desc: '“Imagine how you might book in five years’ time.”' },
  { n: '04', name: 'Platform review', desc: 'Live walkthrough of loveholidays and Mindtrip.', highlight: true },
  { n: '05', name: 'Preferences',     desc: 'Structured comparison questions across both tools.' },
  { n: '06', name: 'Close',           desc: 'Open reflection and wrap-up.' },
];
---

<figure class="sfl">
  <div class="sfl__header">
    <span class="sfl__eyebrow label">Session structure — ~60 minutes</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="sfl__track">
    {stages.map((s) => (
      <li class:list={['sfl__stage', { 'sfl__stage--key': s.highlight }]}>
        <span class="sfl__num">{s.n}</span>
        <p class="sfl__name">{s.name}</p>
        <p class="sfl__desc">{s.desc}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <figcaption class="sfl__caption">
    The same structure ran across all seven sessions. Stage 04 carried the comparative weight —
    participants moved between a structured search interface and a conversational one in a single sitting.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sfl {
    margin-block: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--c-surface);
    max-width: var(--w-content);
    margin-inline: auto;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sfl__header {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem 0;
  }

  .sfl__eyebrow {
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .sfl__track {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .sfl__stage {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem 1rem;
    background: var(--c-base);
  }

  /* Connector between stages */
  .sfl__stage::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -0.75rem;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--c-border-strong);
  }

  .sfl__stage:last-child::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .sfl__stage--key {
    border-color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .sfl__num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--c-ink-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sfl__stage--key .sfl__num {
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .sfl__name {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .sfl__desc {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--c-ink-mid);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sfl__caption {
    padding: 0 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--c-ink-mid);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .sfl__track {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    /* Horizontal connectors don't survive the wrap */
    .sfl__stage::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .sfl__track {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .sfl__header,
    .sfl__caption {
      padding-inline: 1.15rem;
    }
  }
</style>
